# $clearProperties() -> Boolean
# Clears the Property Manager display (e.g. when a tree node is selected
# that represents no object). Uses the shell idiom: a DEFINED but EMPTY
# list passed with isList=kTrue empties the panel (source: oVCS
# $iconclicked). Returns kTrue if the panel was visible and cleared.
Do $root.$modes.$dotoolmethod(kEnvToolBrowser,46) Returns ret ## visible? @CORE
If ret
	Do $root.$modes.$dotoolmethod(kEnvToolBrowser,1,emptyList,kTrue,kFalse) ## @CORE
End If
Quit method ret